On Sat, 2004-07-31 at 19:21, Rikard Johnels wrote:
<snip long explanation>
> Gentoo files # emerge sync
>=20
> <snip (lots of lines)>
>=20
> x11-wm/fluxbox/files/
> xfce-extra/
> rsync: connection unexpectedly closed (1977189 bytes read so far)
> rsync error: error in rsync protocol data stream (code 12) at io.c(150)
>=20
> >>> Updating Portage cache...
>=20
<snip lots more> :D

Make sure you're not using any 2.6.1 or 2.6.2 version of net-misc/rsync.
They are known to cause the 'connection unexpected closed' problem
you're seeing as well as (sometimes) corrupting files in /usr/portage.

Regards,
Bryan =D8stergaard

